[decoded] "Thinking Process:\n\n1.  **Analyze the Request:**\n    *   Input: A set of meeting notes (6 identical copies) describing a hybrid language model architecture.\n    *   Task: Summarize how the model processes a token in three bullet points.\n    *   Constraint: Identify which part grows with the length of the context.\n    *   Input Data: The notes are repetitive (Meetings 1-6 are identical). The core description is in the first paragraph of each meeting note.\n\n2.  **Analyze the Input Data (The Model Description):**\n    *   *Component 1: GatedDeltaNet Layer.*\n        *   Keeps a recurrent state per value head (instead of key-value cache).\n        *   At every position: state decays by a learned factor.\n        *   Key retrieves what the state predicts for it.\n        *   Difference (Value - Prediction) scaled by a learned rate is written back as a rank-one update.\n        *   Query reads the updated state.\n    *   *Component 2: Full Attention Layer.*\n        *   Alternates with GatedDeltaNet (3 GatedDeltaNet layers alternate with 1 Full Attention"
